{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5BTBMbmxk8JgKqdied","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within weathered stone. A deep resonance hums through the frame as centuries of dust cascade from the lintel.*\n\n*Light bleeds through the widening crack — not sunlight, not firelight, but something older. The hinges sing a single, low note that vibrates in your sternum.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n**You stand at the threshold.**\n\nBeyond: a corridor that breathes. The walls pulse with faint bioluminescence — veins of pale gold threading through dark stone. The air tastes of petrichor and copper. Somewhere far below, water moves over ancient things.\n\nThe passage descends.\n\n*I will remain open for you. But I will not remain open forever.*\n\n**Enter, or turn back.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":176,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}